<title>USA: Avondale Financial Corp Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Avondale Financial Corp Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter	  Nine Months</p>
<p>				   1996	1995	 1996     1995</p>
<p>				 (In Thousands Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p> Total interest income    11,150    10,995     33,662  29,583</p>
<p> Total interest expense    6,479     6,527     19,174  17,399</p>
<p> Net interest income	 4,671     4,468     14,488  12,184</p>
<p> Total noninterest income  1,270	 447	2,989   1,565</p>
<p> Total noninterest expense 6,169     3,100     13,704   9,316</p>
<p> Net income		   ( 493)	 892	1,384   2,272</p>
<p> Earnings per share	( 0.14)	0.22	 0.37     n/a</p>
<p> Weighted avg shares  3,602,968 3,978,080  3,764,519     n/a</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 includes $2.4 million or $0.40/share special assessment charge to recapitalize federal depostory insurance fund.</p>
<p>Excluding assessment, Q3 1996 net income would have been $0.26 a share and nine-month net income would have been $0.75 a share.</p>
